a>4.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 直接将年、月、日拼接成字符串。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用更高效的时间复杂度算法。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 使用Python内置函数<code>datetime</code>进行转换。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-3-数学推导（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-3-数学推导（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 数学推导（如适用）\"></a>4.3 数学推导（如适用）</h4><ul>\n<li>关键公式推导过程：<code>year, month, day = datetime.strptime(&#39;19&#39;+i[0]+&#39;/&#39;+i[1]+&#39;/&#39;+i[2], &#39;%Y/%m/%d&#39;)</code></li>\n<li>正确性证明：通过<code>datetime</code>模块提供的<code>strftime</code>方法验证。</li>\n<li>复杂度分析：O(1)时间复杂度，O(1)空间复杂度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\"><a href=\"#4-4-多种解法对比（如适用）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）\"></a>4.4 多种解法对比（如适用）</h4><div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代码难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>解法1</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>小规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法2</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>中等规模数据</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解法3</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>大规模数据</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"5-代码详解\"><a href=\"#5-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 代码详解\"></a>5. 代码详解</h3><h4 id=\"5-1-核心代码段\"><a href=\"#5-1-核心代码段\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 核心代码段\"></a>5.1 核心代码段</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> datetime <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> datetime, timedelta</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    year, month, day = <span class=\"built_in\">map</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">input</span>().split(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 根据两位年份推出完整年份</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">60</span> &lt;= year &lt;= <span class=\"number\">99</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        year = <span class=\"number\">1900</span> + year</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">elif</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= year &lt;= <span class=\"number\">59</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        year = <span class=\"number\">2000</span> + year</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">continue</span>   <span class=\"comment\"># 理论上不会出现，但防万一</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 创建日期对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    d = datetime(year, month, day)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 如果日期无效，则返回None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"literal\">None</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 判断是否在有效范围内</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">1960</span> &lt;= year &lt;= <span class=\"number\">2059</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            d_obj = datetime(year, month, day)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> d_obj <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> res:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                res.append(d_obj)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> ValueError:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">pass</span>   <span class=\"comment\"># 非法日期直接跳过</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 排序并打印结果</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    res.sort()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> res:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(d.strftime(<span class=\"string\">&quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot;</span>))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"5-2-逐行解析\"><a href=\"#5-2-逐行解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 逐行解析\"></a>5.2 逐行解析</h4><ul>\n<li><code>from datetime import datetime, timedelta</code>：导入所需的<code>datetime</code>和<code>timedelta</code>类。</li>\n<li><code>def solve():</code>：定义函数名和参数。</li>\n<li><code>year, month, day = map(int, input().split(&#39;/&#39;))</code>：从输入中获取年、月、日，并将其转换为整数。</li>\n<li><code>if 60 &lt;= year &lt;= 99:</code>：判断年份是否在合理范围内。</li>\n<li><code>elif 0 &lt;= year &lt;= 59:</code>：判断年份是否在合理范围内。</li>\n<li><code>else:</code>：如果年份不在合理范围内，则跳过此循环。</li>\n<li><code>d = datetime(year, month, day)</code>：创建一个日期对象。</li>\n<li><code>if d is None:</code>：如果日期对象为空，则返回None。</li>\n<li><code>if d_obj not in res:</code>：判断日期对象是否在已存结果中。</li>\n<li><code>res.append(d_obj)</code>：如果日期对象不在结果中，则将其添加到结果列表中。</li>\n<li><code>res.sort()</code>：对结果列表进行排序。</li>\n<li><code>for d in res:</code>：遍历结果列表并打印每个日期。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#6-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 复杂度分析\"></a>6. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>：O(n log n)，其中n是输入的年、月、日的总和。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>：O(n)，用于存储结果列表。</li>\n<li><strong>复杂度对比</strong>：与朴素解法相比，时间复杂度降低，空间复杂度不变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#7-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 输入输出示例\"></a>7. 输入输出示例</h3><h4 id=\"样例输入\"><a href=\"#样例输入\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输入\"></a>样例输入</h4><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1984/01/01</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"样例输出\"><a href=\"#样例输出\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"样例输出\"></a>样例输出</h4><figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1984-01-01</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"算法名称：日期问题-蓝桥杯-2017-省-B\"><a href=\"#算法名称：日期问题-蓝桥杯-2017-省-B\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"算法名称：日期问题 - 蓝桥杯 2017 省 B\"></a>算法名称：日期问题 - 蓝桥杯 2017 省 B</h2><h3 id=\"1-标题\"><a href=\"#1-标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 标题\"></a>1. 标题</h3><h4 id=\"蓝桥杯-P861-日期问题-核心优化技巧\"><a href=\"#蓝桥杯-P861-日期问题-核心优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"蓝桥杯 P861 日期问题 + 核心优化技巧\"></a>蓝桥杯 P861 日期问题 + 核心优化技巧</h4><h3 id=\"2-题目概览\"><a href=\"#2-题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题目概览\"></a>2. 题目概览</h3><h4 id=\"题目来源\"><a href=\"#题目来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目来源\"></a>题目来源</h4><ul>\n<li>题目链接：<a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P861\">https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P861</a></li>\n<li>题面简述：<br/><br>输入输出样例：<br/><br>难度等级：★★★☆☆<br>标签分类：算法、数据结构<br>核心考点：日期问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-题意解析\"><a href=\"#3-题